  "description": "Compile-time source generator that auto-registers ASP.NET Core Minimal API\n      endpoints from attribute-decorated classes. Zero reflection, Native AOT safe.\n      Supports .NET 8, 9, and 10.",
  "iconFile": "icon.png",
  "id": "MinimalApiGen",
