  "packageSize": 44192,
  "published": "2026-09-02T08:26:22.77Z",
  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "1.0.0\n- Initial release.\n- Attributes: RouteGroup (route prefix + OpenAPI Tag), Get/Post/Put/Patch/Delete, AuthorizeEndpoint (method- or class-level, with method-level taking precedence and AllowAnonymousEndpoint able to opt a method out of a class-level policy), AllowAnonymousEndpoint, ApiVersion, EndpointMeta (Summary + Description), ExcludeFromGeneration.\n- Diagnostics: MAG001 (missing route param), MAG002 (method must be static), MAG003 (missing [RouteGroup]), MAG004 (conflicting auth attributes on the same method).\n- Supports .NET 8.0, 9.0 and 10.0 (and any netstandard2.0-compatible target) — zero reflection, Native AOT safe.",
